OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of homes evacuated in
OL,4,AFalmouth over unexploded WW2 bomb in
OL,5,Adocks
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 300 homes in Falmouth have
OL,8,Fbeen evacuated as experts deal with a
OL,9,FWorld War Two bomb
OL,11,FEmergency services were initially
OL,12,Fcalled to Falmouth Docks at 09:15 BST
OL,13,Fon Monday after the suspected 250lb
OL,14,F(115kg) American World War Two
OL,15,Fair-dropped device was found in the
OL,16,Fwater
OL,18,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone was
OL,19,Fpreviously in place which has since
OL,20,Fbeen expanded to 755m (2,477ft)
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
