OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of homes evacuated in
OL,4,AFalmouth over unexploded WW2 bomb in
OL,5,Adocks
OL,6,
OL,7,FGWR suspends train services between
OL,8,FFalmouth Docks and Falmouth Town
OL,9,Fstations
OL,11,FSuperintendent Ian Thompson, from Devon
OL,12,Fand Cornwall Police, previously warned:
OL,13,F"If the cordon is extended and you live
OL,14,Fwithin this area, you are strongly
OL,15,Furged to leave your home by 09:00 BST
